// plugin.rc - archive icons registered as DefaultIcon by association.cpp, one block per icon style
// (association::kIconStyleStride apart, in this order): 101-115 "document", 121-135 "zipper folder" and
// 141-155 "colour page", all rendered from archive_icon_styles_mockup.html by
// tools/generate_7zip_archive_icons.py. 16/20/24 px use the simplified art, 32-256 px the full one.
